ization", 381.18], ["that", 381.64], ["I", 382.36], ["needed", 382.5], ["more", 382.72], ["rest.", 383.06]], [["It", 387.62], ["was", 387.72], ["a", 387.84], ["big", 387.94], ["realization", 388.18], ["for", 388.64], ["me.", 389.32]]], "z": [384.14, 390.2], "o": 393.64}, "src": {"t": "Is that a realization you think you could have gotten to had you not had some success in the first place?", "a": "audio/t02/s12.mp3", "hl": [10, 21], "sp": "Chris", "oa": "audio/t02o/s12.mp3", "oab": [0, 2.47], "oas": ["audio/t02o/s12.mp3"]}}, {"n": 12, "w": "ascetic", "pos": "n./adj.", "zh": "苦行者；禁欲的", "ex": "An ascetic is a person who gives up comfort and pleasure, often for spiritual reasons. Naval says he didn't want to live with nothing, like a monk. Pronounced uh-SET-ik.", "exs": ["He lived like an ascetic, with almost no furniture.", "I'm not going to live an ascetic life just to save money."], "t": 397.31, "tt": {"w": 397.31, "ex": [["An", 400.1], ["ascetic", 400.18], ["is", 400.58], ["a", 400.8], ["person", 400.9], ["who", 401.18], ["gives", 401.46], ["up", 401.64], ["comfort", 401.84], ["and", 402.28], ["pleasure,", 402.54], ["often", 403.38], ["for", 403.66], ["spiritual", 403.9], ["reasons.", 404.32], ["Naval", 405.56], ["says", 405.94], ["he", 406.25], ["didn't", 406.44], ["want", 406.88], ["to", 407.2], ["live", 407.39], ["with", 407.7], ["nothing,", 408.02], ["like", 408.58], ["a", 408.9], ["monk.", 409.02], ["Pronounced", 409.4], ["uh-SET-ik.", 410.09]], "exs": [[["He", 414.04], ["lived", 414.21], ["like", 414.55], ["an", 414.83], ["ascetic,", 414.99], ["with", 415.5], ["almost", 415.77], ["no", 416.16], ["furniture.", 416.33]], [["I'm", 422.73], ["not", 422.96], ["going", 423.2], ["to", 423.55], ["live", 423.72], ["an", 424.02], ["ascetic", 424.19], ["life", 424.66], ["just", 424.95], ["to", 425.25], ["save", 425.42], ["money.", 425.71]]], "z": [417.81, 426.97], "o": 431.29}, "src": {"t": "I was not going to go be an ascetic and sit there and renounce everything. That 